&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Step 1: Submit your resume and responses to our application questions in full&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Step 2: Meet with our recruiter and submit your responses to our video questions via &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sparkhire.com/candidates/?kw=recruiting%20software&amp;amp;cpn=22174964794&amp;amp;gad_source=1&amp;amp;gad_campaignid=22174964794&amp;amp;gbraid=0AAAAADjd1-lX_b6SS4kB1XQm8qWpVCb4R&amp;amp;gclid=CjwKCAiAmp3LBhAkEiwAJM2JUDfHysTOEvcUh2-KIHpmaA2VcLFOh-kr6WFZGVhxYbTBKIL1HJCPCBoCEQAQAvD_BwE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Spark Hire&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;- please note that we &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;do not&lt;/span&gt; use AI to asses submissions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
